  "summary": "aiohttp server lacks an initial request/header timeout",
  "details": "### Summary\n\nThe keepalive timeout was not used during the initial portion of a request.\n\n### Impact\n\nAn attacker could keep an idle connection open indefinitely before sending any data.\n\n### Workaround\n\nUse a reverse proxy (as recommended for all production deployments) with sensible keepalive limits.",
